RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, and April to May in 32. On that same middle, 2025 ran 55% of normal in July to August and 46% in November to December, while 2026 so far shows March to April at 171%. Grid 21748 had its driest year in 1953, at 56% of normal.</p>"}
